sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Product as Mesa Tica
    Customer->>Product: Leave tracking page open
    loop While page open with working connection
    Product-->>Customer: Automatically updated status and last successful check
    end
    alt Connection or updates fail
    Product-->>Customer: Keep last status/time, warn information may be outdated
    else Successful recovery
    Product-->>Customer: Current status, new check time, clear warning
    end
    Note over Customer,Product: Never show a fabricated status before the first successful load.
